  "headline": "FDA's records show cefazolin sodium is not on the current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; an earlier shortage was first posted 2018-11-30 and is resolved",
  "headline_cites": ["D14"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show cefazolin sodium is not on the current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; an earlier shortage was first posted 2018-11-30 and is resolved.",
      "cites": ["D14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspected the Hikma Farmaceutica (Portugal) S.A. plant (FEI 3002807173) multiple times, including an OAI classification on 2014-03-28 and a Warning Letter on 2014-10-21, with the most recent VAI on 2023-04-21.",
      "cites": ["E15", "E21", "E20"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The 2018-11-30 shortage posting came 962 days after a VAI inspection ended 2016-04-12 at that plant.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later VAI inspection ended 2020-03-06, 462 days after the 2018-11-30 posting.",
      "cites": ["D13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 128 units of the 2 g/50 mL presentation at 14.4 per day (8.9 days on hand) and Corvale General holds 279 units at 16.1 per day (17.3 days on hand).",
      "cites": ["D4", "D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to transfer 53 units of 2 g/50 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would leave Corvale General with 14 days and bring Corvale East to 13 days.",
      "cites": ["D15"]
    }
  ]
}
